{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PLURA is a fiction game made with some adaptations based on real events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>&lt;Story&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Me and Mike.James and Brick are experienced technical divers. Today we will set a world record by exploring the Pluragrotta underwater cave in Norway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But an unexpected tragic accident happens.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>&lt;Game Features&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1st person 3D short horror game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four ending</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">fear of survival</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some key customization features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>&lt;Playtime&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It will take about an hour or more to see all the endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&lt;<i><strong>Developer Story</strong></i>&gt;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One-man Development, Sixteen Years of Development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>&lt;Video Content Guidelines&gt;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Both individuals and businesses can upload and broadcast videos without separate permission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">VVC GAMES is not liable for any damage caused by uploading and broadcasting game videos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">These guidelines are subject to change without prior notice.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637420?t=1744282949","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3637420?t=1744282949","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637420/5fd29558432bbc7d24e811ddd4a81c593176b81e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744282949","capsule_imagev5"